{"type":"message","id":"fc2447f4","parentId":"09865318","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:34:59.595Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to look at the A-801 finish schedule page and the construction floor plan more carefully. Let me also check what page_008 actually is - it's the demolition plans page_025. Wait, page_008 = A-101 Construction Plan. But the image I got was page_025 which is AD-101 Demolition Plans. Let me re-check.\n\nActually looking at the sheet index: A-101 = page_008. But the image showed demolition plans. Let me re-read the actual A-101 construction plan page and the A-801 finish schedule.\n\nWait, looking again at the images - page_008 image does show demolition plans at bottom and what looks like entrance canopy at top. \n\nThe page numbering seems inconsistent with the sheet index - page_008 is labeled as A-101 but actually displays demolition plans with reflected ceiling demolition plan and demolition plan sections visible at the bottom.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Let me find the actual construction plan and finish schedule pages."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01N16XSuJNFhgYUmuXWWkFpT","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/text/page_008.txt"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01DK67CZ1PWbG8n6BNBiuCga","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/text/page_009.txt"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Cr8LroP1unzuZWV5QtSrUS","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/text/page_025.txt"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":614,"cacheRead":44903,"cacheWrite":6902,"totalTokens":52420,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.01535,"cacheRead":0.0224515,"cacheWrite":0.0431375,"total":0.080944}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":177006