K \nELEMENTS.\n8. \nCONTRACTOR SHALL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR LEVELING FLOOR TO COVER \nMILLWORK TOLERANCES, FLOOR FINISHES, ETC.\nP-1\nLVT-1\nRB-1\nPWP-1\nWALL\nFLOOR\nBASE\nWALL PROTECTION \nWALL PROTECTION (REFER TO WALL PROTECTION LEGEND):\nPWP-#\nCG-1\nPWP =  PLASTIC WALL PROTECTION\nPWP-1\nBASE AS \nSCHEDULED\nPWP-1\nPWP-1\nNOTES:\n1. \nRUN SHEETS OF WALL PROTECTION HORIZONTALLY TO MINIMIZE SEAMS.\n2. \nTHE SECTION TAG INFORMATION SHOWN ON KEY ELEVATION ABOVE IS \nFOR ALL WALL PROTECTION UNLESS NOTED OTHERWISE\nELEVATION VIEW\n5'-0\" U.N.O.\nCG-1\n200 MADISON AVENUE, 14TH FLOOR\nNEW YORK, NY 10016\n212-689-3110\nARRAY-ARCHITECTS.COM\nPROJECT NO.\nDATE\nCONTRACT NO.\nCON/REF NO.\nF\nE\nD\nC\nB\nA\n8\n7\n6\n5\n4\n3\n2\n1\nC  COPYRIGHT - 2025 ARRAY ARCHITECTS\nIN COLLABORATION WITH:\nDOSHI ENGINEERING PLLC\nMEP ENGINEER\n350 SEVENTH AVENUE, 15th FLOOR,\nNEW YORK, NY 10001\nPHONE: 718 896 9324\nPROJECT:\nISSUES:\nSEAL:\nKEYPLAN:\nYSRAEL A. SEINUK, P.C.\nSTRUCTURAL ENGINEER\n228 EAST 45TH STREET, 2ND FLOOR\nNEW YORK, NY  10017\nPHONE: 212 687 2233\nYU & ASSOCIATES\nGEOTECHNICAL & CIVIL ENGINEER\n611 RIVER DRIVE\nELMWOOD PARK, NY  07407\nPHONE: 201 791 0057\nMG ENGINEERING D.P.C.\nMEDICAL EQ, AV/IT, SECURITY ENGINEER\n116 WEST 32ND STREET\nNEW YORK, NY  10001\nPHONE: 212 643 9055  \nENVIRONMENTAL PLANNING \nMANAGEMENT\nENVIRONMENTAL ENGINEER\n1983 MARCUS AVENUE, SUITE 109\nLAKE SUCCESS, NY  11042\nPHONE: 516 328 1194 \n9/25/2025 10:54:11 AM\nAutodesk Docs://6829 - H+H Bellevue Ambulance Bay Addition/6829-ARCH- ED ADDITION-25.rvt\nISSUED SOLUTION FOR BID\n09/25/25 A-801 .00\nFINISH FLOOR\nPLAN, FURNITURE\nPLAN  AND\nSCHEDULES\nED AMBULANCE\nBAY ADDITION\nH+H Bellevue\n6829\n09/25/25\n462 1st Avenue, New York, NY 10016\nISSUED SOLTUION FOR BID 2025\n1/8\" = 1'-0\"\nA5\nINTERIOR FURNITURE PLAN\n1/8\" = 1'-0\"\nA8\nINTERIOR FINISH PLAN\nFINISH SCHEDULE\n..\nMANUFACTURER\nSTYLE\nCOLOR\nDIMENSIONS\nFINISH NOTES\nLOCATION\nMANUFACTURER'S REP\nCEILING\nCEILING\nC-1\nARMSTRONG\n32