{"type":"message","id":"803241d1","parentId":"60545dfc","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:35:47.961Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01EmeKw4TaSE8rtuReSBmipM","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This page (M-302.00, Mechanical Details 2 of 9) does **not contain any mechanical equipment schedules**. It contains:\n\n1. **Pipe Hanging Detail** with a **Pipe Hanger Rod and Spacing Schedule** (not equipment)\n2. **Schedule of Single Line Ductwork** (duct sizing reference, not equipment)\n3. **Detail of Piping Piercing Fire Rated Partitions, Walls and Floors**\n4. **AC Units / BC Controller Installation Detail**\n5. **Funnel Drain Installation Detail**\n6. **Pipe Sleeve Through Floor Slab Detail**\n7. **Condensate Drain Size** reference table\n\n---\n\nThe two reference tables present are:\n\n**Pipe Hanger Rod and Spacing Schedule:**\n\n| Nominal Pipe/Tube Size (inches) | 5/8 | 3/4 | 7/8 | 1 | 1-1/2 | 2 | 2-1/2 | – | – | – | – |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Hanger Rod Sizes (inches) | 3/8 | 3/8 | 3/8 | 1/8 | 3/8 | 3/8 | 3/8 | – | – | – | – |\n| Max Spacing Between Pipe Supports (ft) | – | 6 | – | 7 | 9 | 10 | 11 | – | – | – | – |\n| Max Spacing Between Cu. Tube Supports (ft) | 6 | 6 | 6 | 6 | 8 | 9 | 10 | – | – | – | – |\n\n**Schedule of Single Line Ductwork:**\n\n| Duct CFM | Sq. In. Min. | Rectangular | Round (Ø) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 0 to 100 | 32 | 8x4 | 7 |\n| 125 to 175 | 48 | 8x6 | 8 |"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_052.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770064547952}}
{"type":"message","id":"783f54fd","parentId":"803241d1","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:35:53.287Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The mechanical schedules are on page_052 (M-201), not M-302. Let me check the actual M-201 page.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01YVoAiZiRWczf6YK5J6VaKr","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_052.png","prompt":"What sheet number is this? What is the title? List everything visible on this page."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01TKg49SrDXrtDV1cRrExCTk","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/text/page_037.txt","limit":50}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":247,"cacheRead":79357,"cacheWrite":1144,"totalTokens":80749,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.006175,"cacheRead":0.0396785,"cacheWrite":0.00715,"total":0.0530085}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770064547961}}
{"type":"message","id":"8ddbe91d","parentId":"783f54fd","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:36:10.002Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01YVoAiZiRWczf6YK5J6VaKr","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Sheet Number:** M-302.00\n\n**Title:** MECHANICAL DETAILS (2 OF 9)\n\n**Project:** ED Ambulance Bay Addition (H+H Bellevue)\n\n**Visible items on the page:**\n\n1. **Notes** (1-4) — regarding weather proof coating, O&M manuals, cooling/heating load procedures, thermostat set points\n2. **Detail of Piping Piercing Fire Rated Partitions, Walls and Floors** — with labeled components (bare pipe, insulated hot pipe, sleeve, escutcheon, fire resistant foam seal, mineral wool, calcium silicate insulation, fiberglass insulation, fire stop sealant, etc.)\n3. **Pipe Hanging Detail** — showing clevis hanger with saddle, metal deck, ceiling bolt, threaded rod, heavy density permolded pipe insulation\n4. **Pipe Hanger Rod and Spacing Schedule** — table with nominal pipe sizes, hanger rod sizes, max spacing between supports\n5. **Schedule of Single Line Ductwork** — table with duct CFM ranges, square inches minimum, recommended rectangular and round duct sizes\n6. **AC Units / BC Controller Installation Detail** — showing supply air, return air, spring vibration isolator, water sensor, condensate piping, condensate drain size table, supplemental drain pan, steel angles, threaded rod, concrete slab\n7. **Funnel Drain Installation Detail** — showing condensate drain, 2\" dia funnel, P-trap, sanitary waste pipe\n8. **Pipe Sleeve Through Floor Slab Detail** — showing steel pipe sleeve, firestopping, escutcheon plate, caulking\n9. **Title Block** (right side) — ARRAY Architects, project info, consultant listings (MEP engineer, structural engineer, civil engineer, etc.)\n10. **Key Plan** (small building outline)\n11. **Issues list** — 5 entries with dates (04.07.25 through 09.25.25)\n12. **Project No.:** 6829, **Contract No.:** 09/25/25"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_052.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770064569995}}
