{"type":"message","id":"c80755f3","parentId":"5689108a","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:41:45.675Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All files created. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n---\n\n## Task Complete — Pipeline V2 Results\n\n### PATH B: Schedule Extraction (8 structured JSON files)\n- **doors.json** — 8 doors extracted (ED-1-01 through ED-1-09, excluding missing ED-1-05). Every column: mark, room, type, size, material, finish, glazing, frame, rating, hardware set, remarks.\n- **finishes.json** — 5 rooms with floor, base, walls, ceiling type, ceiling height, wall protection assignments\n- **finish_legend.json** — Complete product catalog: 2 ceiling types, 3 paints, 2 porcelain tiles, 1 special wall coating, 2 epoxy floors, 2 integral bases, 1 walk-off mat, 4 wall protection types, 3 millwork materials\n- **partitions.json** — 4 existing types (A-D) + 7 new types (2, 2A, 2B, 7D, 7E, 7F, 7G) with full assembly descriptions, STC ratings, ballistic panel requirements\n- **millwork.json** — 1 location (Security desk) with all material callouts\n- **ceiling_keynotes.json** — 9 ceiling keynotes + 17 general notes + security ceiling requirements\n- **electrical_panels.json** — Panelboard schedule from E-301 with 22+ circuit entries\n- **light_fixtures.json** — 5 fixture types identified from RCP (25 total counted)\n\n### PATH A: Drawing Takeoff (drawing_counts.json)\n- 8 doors on plans, 5 rooms, 5 partition types tagged, 25 light fixtures, plus equipment/demo counts\n\n### PHASE 1.5: Convergence Validation (convergence_report.json)\n- **7 MATCH** / **1 MISMATCH** (partition types - expected) / **1 PARTIAL** (light fixtures)\n- Overall confidence: **HIGH**\n\n### Key Corrections Applied to quantities.json\n1. **Item 48 (Storefronts): 3 → 6 EA** — counting each individual AL door unit\n2. **Item 47 (Access Panels): 6 → 0 EA** — explicitly NOT quantified on drawings per Note 10\n3. **ED-1-05: Flagged** — missing from both schedule AND plans (consistent absence, needs RFI)\n4. **MAT-1 walk-off mat: Flagged** as owner-furnished (provided by H+H)"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":619,"cacheRead":101439,"cacheWrite":750,"totalTokens":102809,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.015475000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0507195,"cacheWrite":0.0046875,"total":0.07088699999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1770064888101}}
